.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH swarm-daemon 1  "swarm 0.1.0" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-daemon \- Start, stop or restart the background daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm daemon\fR [\fB\-\-foreground\fR] [\fB\-\-experimental\-udp\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Start, stop or restart the background daemon
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-foreground\fR
Run the daemon in this terminal (for service managers)
.TP
\fB\-\-experimental\-udp\fR
Try direct UDP paths between relayed peers (experimental)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
swarm\-daemon\-start(1)
Start the daemon in the background
.TP
swarm\-daemon\-stop(1)
Stop the running daemon
.TP
swarm\-daemon\-restart(1)
Stop the daemon if it is running, then start it
